dialect protocol
protocol procedural2d.spr
version 1
schema procedural.2d.mutation
start record
framing record
record procedural.procedural2d-add-vertex tag=1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record procedural.procedural2d-set-face tag=2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record procedural.procedural2d-transform-mesh tag=3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
